== Trivia ==
* Neptunus, as well as {{i|Jupiter}}, was designed for the original ''Antibirth'' mod, but never actually implemented until ''Repentance''.
* Neptunus' effects and pickup quote reference the Roman god of the sea, [[wikipedia:Neptune (mythology)|Neptune]].

